265
00:13:10,501 --> 00:13:13,700
You could skydive and count yourself

266
00:13:13,701 --> 00:13:18,000
among one of the more than 3 million jumps that take place

267
00:13:18,001 --> 00:13:19,300
every year.

268
00:13:19,301 --> 00:13:24,140
or join one of the estimated 1.5 million people in the world

269
00:13:24,141 --> 00:13:25,140
who kiteboard.

270
00:13:29,260 --> 00:13:35,600
But now there is another machine that can get you up in the air.

271
00:13:35,601 --> 00:13:38,740
Black Hawk Motors designs and manufactures

272
00:13:38,741 --> 00:13:41,700
paramotoring equipment.

273
00:13:41,701 --> 00:13:44,400
Anybody can use our paramotors.

274
00:13:44,401 --> 00:13:47,420
The FAA do not require you to have a license

275
00:13:47,421 --> 00:13:49,200
