286
00:14:17,001 --> 00:14:21,000
Trainees here have multiple options to get off the ground.

287
00:14:21,001 --> 00:14:24,280
You can strap on an engine and run towards flight,

288
00:14:24,281 --> 00:14:29,240
or you can use vehicles that are literally driven into the air.

289
00:14:29,241 --> 00:14:32,040
Our best selling unit right now is the Lowboy 3

290
00:14:32,041 --> 00:14:35,360
Quad with the Aero 1000 four stroke engine.

291
00:14:35,361 --> 00:14:38,660
Cruises at around 25 to 30 miles an hour.

292
00:14:38,661 --> 00:14:42,300
It uses approximately one gallon of fuel per hour.

293
00:14:42,301 --> 00:14:45,660
So you can go close to five hours with that.

294
00:14:45,661 --> 00:14:49,560
And today, we'll see the Lowboy 3 quad in the air

